---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="Information about affiliate links on booxnet.com – how we earn money and how it does (not) influence our content."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-ink-200">
      <p class="text-2xs font-bold uppercase tracking-editorial text-ink-400 mb-3">
        Transparency
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink-900 mb-2 tracking-tight">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-500 text-lg">Transparency about how this site is funded</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-article">
      <p class="lead text-lg text-ink-600">
        Transparency matters to us. This page explains how booxnet.com uses affiliate
        links and how that affects our editorial independence.
      </p>

      <h2>What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
      <p>
        When we link to a product and you buy through that link, we receive a small
        commission from the retailer (e.g. Amazon). You pay <strong>no extra cost</strong> –
        the price is identical to buying directly.
      </p>

      <h2>Labeling</h2>
      <p>
        Articles containing affiliate links are clearly labeled. You will see a
        disclosure notice at the beginning of the article and a short note at the end.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Principles</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Independent opinions:</strong> Affiliate commissions do not influence our
          ratings. We write honest reviews, even when that means criticizing a device's flaws.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No paid reviews:</strong> We do not accept payments from manufacturers
          in exchange for positive coverage.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Only products we recommend:</strong> We only link to products we
          consider genuinely worth buying.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Transparency:</strong> We label all affiliate links in accordance with
          legal requirements.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Affiliate Programs We Participate In</h2>
      <p>booxnet.com participates in the following affiliate programs:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Amazon Associates:</strong> As an Amazon Associate we earn from
          qualifying purchases. Amazon and the Amazon logo are trademarks of
          Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>No Cost to You</h2>
      <p>
        To be clear: affiliate links cost you nothing extra. The price you pay is
        identical to a direct purchase. Buying through our links supports booxnet.com
        in continuing to create free content.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about our affiliate usage, or want to report an incorrectly labeled
        link? Reach us via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
